---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import FontTool from '../components/FontTool.astro';
import FaqSection from '../components/FaqSection.astro';
import SchemaOrg from '../components/SchemaOrg.astro';
import { t, getPath } from '../i18n';

const lang = 'en';
const strings = t(lang);

const siteUrl = Astro.site?.toString().replace(/\/$/, '') ?? '';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const pageUrl = siteUrl + getPath(lang, '/');
const logoUrl = `${siteUrl}${base}logo.svg`;
---

<BaseLayout
  lang={lang}
  title="Font Generator (𝔽𝕒𝕟𝕔𝕪 𝕿𝖊𝖝𝖙) Copy & Paste Font Styles"
  description="Font Generator 500+ font styles convert instantly. Copy and paste fancy text, cool, bold, cursive, aesthetic for Instagram, TikTok, Twitch, and Discord. FREE."
  path="/"
>
  <FontTool lang={lang} />

<article class="prose wrap max-w-[820px] mx-auto py-10">

<p>A <strong>font</strong> is basically the <strong>visual style of text</strong>. It changes how letters, numbers, and symbols look on your screen or on paper.</p>

<p>But when you are on <strong>social media or online games</strong>, you may want your name, bio, username, or message to look a little different. The app may not give you many options for this.</p>

<p>That's where <strong>cool fancy text</strong> comes in. There are hundreds of decorative and stylized text variations like <strong>𝔽𝕒𝕟𝕔𝕪</strong>, <strong>𝕿𝖊𝖝𝖙</strong>, or <strong>🄱🄾🅇🄴🄳</strong> that can make your text stand out. You can simply copy and paste these styles wherever you want.</p>

<p>You can try different styles to find the one that fits your mood, personality, or the type of message you want to share. There is no need to install any font library or download anything.</p>

<h2>Copy a Font Style for Every Mood</h2>

<p><strong>AestheticFonts</strong> is a Online <strong>font generator and fancy letters tool</strong> that turns normal text into stylish fonts, cool symbols, decorative letters, and unique text styles. Create <strong>aesthetic text, fancy usernames, social media bios, captions, gaming names, and creative messages</strong>, then copy and paste your favorite style instantly. No signup, downloads, or font installation needed.</p>

<p>On AestheticFonts, we have a collection of different text styles, from <strong>𝔉𝔯𝔞𝔨𝔱𝔲𝔯</strong> and <strong>𝘐𝘵𝘢𝘭𝘪𝘤</strong> to <strong>𝓒𝓾𝓻𝓼𝓲𝓿𝓮 𝓑𝓸𝓵𝓭</strong>, <strong>Ⓑⓤⓑⓑⓛⓔⓢ</strong>, <strong>Emojis</strong> and <strong>ՏφՄɿԳԳʅe</strong>. You can also explore unusual <strong>text symbols</strong> and creative styles to give your text a different look.</p>

<p>These styles can be used in <strong>Instagram bios, Discord usernames, Facebook posts, gaming profiles, Whatsapp chats, comments, captions, and online chats</strong>. Some styles are simple and clean, while others are more decorative or playful.</p>

<p>Here are some of the <strong>font styles you can generate with AestheticFonts</strong>:</p>

